@ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5122

### Health
GET {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Auth
POST {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@pbms.local",
  "password": "your_password"
}

### Slots
GET {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/slots
GET {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/slots/map

### Check-in
POST {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parking-sessions/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "51A-12345",
  "vehicleTypeId": 2,
  "entryStaffId": 1,
  "entryGate": "Gate-A"
}

### Check-out
POST {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parking-sessions/1/check-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "exitStaffId": 1,
  "exitGate": "Gate-A"
}

### Dashboard
GET {{ParkingBuildingManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/dashboard
